    "site_desc": "The study site is a fen within the Marcell Experimental Forest, which has been monitored for fluxes and environmental variables at various points in time.  In 2007 an EC tower was established to monitor CO2/H2O fluxes within the peatland.  Methane observations were added in 2009 and have been ongoing since.  This site has also been referred to as Bog Lake Fen in the past.",
